
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Something Went Wrong | LetsStudy Pro</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0f172a">

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}

body{
  margin:0;
  min-height:100vh;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:20px;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:#f1f5f9;
  color:#0f172a;
}

.container{
  width:100%;
  max-width:620px;
  padding:45px 30px;
  background:white;
  border-radius:20px;
  text-align:center;
  box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
}

.logo{
  font-size:24px;
  font-weight:bold;
  color:#2563eb;
  margin-bottom:35px;
}

.icon{
  width:95px;
  height:95px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  margin:0 auto 25px;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:#fee2e2;
  color:#dc2626;
  font-size:45px;
}

.code{
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:bold;
  color:#dc2626;
  letter-spacing:3px;
  margin-bottom:12px;
}

h1{
  font-size:29px;
  margin:10px 0 15px;
}

.description{
  color:#64748b;
  font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.8;
}

.info{
  background:#fff7ed;
  border:1px solid #fed7aa;
  padding:17px;
  border-radius:12px;
  color:#9a3412;
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.8;
  margin:25px 0;
}

.buttons{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:12px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:25px;
}

button,a{
  border:none;
  padding:14px 22px;
  border-radius:9px;
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:bold;
  cursor:pointer;
  text-decoration:none;
}

.primary{
  background:#2563eb;
  color:white;
}

.secondary{
  background:#e2e8f0;
  color:#334155;
}

button:hover,.primary:hover{
  background:#1d4ed8;
}

footer{
  margin-top:35px;
  font-size:12px;
  color:#94a3b8;
}

@media(max-width:480px){
  .container{padding:35px 20px}
  h1{font-size:24px}
  .icon{width:85px;height:85px;font-size:38px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

  <div class="logo">LetsStudy Pro</div>

  <div class="icon">⚠</div>

  <div class="code">SYSTEM ERROR</div>

  <h1>Something Went Wrong!</h1>

  <p class="description">
    We are sorry, but something unexpected happened
    while processing your request.
    Please try again or return to the homepage.
  </p>

  <div class="info">
    <strong>How can you fix this?</strong><br>
    • Refresh the current page.<br>
    • Check your internet connection.<br>
    • Try again after a few moments.<br>
    • Contact our support team if the problem continues.
  </div>

  <div class="buttons">
    <button class="primary" onclick="location.reload()">
      Try Again
    </button>

    <a href="/" class="secondary">
      Go to Homepage
    </a>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size:13px;color:#64748b;margin-top:25px">
    Need help?
    <a href="mailto:support@letsstudy.pro"
       style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none">
      Contact Support
    </a>
  </p>

  <footer>
    LetsStudy Pro · The Digital Ecosystem<br>
    Learn. Build. Work. Grow.
  </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
